      "en": "He calls to the heavens above, to the earth, that he may judge his people:",
      "ko": "하나님이 그 백성을 판단하시려고 윗 하늘과 아래 땅에 반포하여",
      "source_text_hash": "c5662ea3d660c9b7f939ceeea10b79b8f1b0b5c7fa1c073b1a5c3dea21e1ab5d",
      "translation_text_hash": "92e99836c5bda9189122cf2caa8405bd2415f3e3f86de70a67d28318519af075",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "하나님이 그 백성을 판단하시려고 윗 하늘과 아래 땅에 반포하여"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "92e99836c5bda9189122cf2caa8405bd2415f3e3f86de70a67d28318519af075"
      ]
    },
